nt":"截至快照日已解锁的任务批次数，单位：批。真解锁口径的判据。⚠️这是自然日补齐的结果，不是登录次数","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"last_unlock_date","ordinal":10,"type":"datetime","nullable":true,"comment":"最近一次解锁的业务日。解锁由回到赛事触发，不需打比赛","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_open_cnt_calendar","ordinal":11,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"【计划解锁日口径】截至快照日计划解锁日已到的任务位数，单位：个。统计方式：SUM。⚠️不含玩家行为，玩家流失后仍随日历增长。实测全量4068万","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_open_cnt_unlocked","ordinal":12,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"【真解锁口径】截至快照日真实解锁的任务位数，单位：个。统计方式：SUM。判据 day_no<=unlock_days。实测全量1490万，为上一列的1/2.73","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_done_cnt","ordinal":13,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日已完成的任务位数，单位：个。统计方式：SUM","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_done_cnt_in_unlocked","ordinal":14,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日在真实解锁批次内完成的任务位数，单位：个。统计方式：SUM","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_done_cnt_pre_unlock","ordinal":15,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日在尚未到计划解锁日时就完成的任务位数，单位：个。源于活动配置 pre_mode=1 解锁前累计进度，实测占已完成19.1%","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_claim_cnt","ordinal":16,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日已领取任务奖励的任务位数，单位：个。统计方式：SUM","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"task_claim_mask","ordinal":17,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"任务位领奖位图。第 (day_no-1)*5+task_no 位为1表示该任务位已领奖，占用低 35 位（aid=2 为 7 批 × 5 位）。实测 BIT_COUNT(该列) 与 task_claim_cnt 在 1,349,604 个玩家上 100% 相等。⚠️目的是让「当日领了哪几个任务奖」在 30 天之后仍可追溯：当日新领 = 今日值 & ~昨日值（领奖单调只增位，该式精确）。30 天以内可直接在 dwd_ops_task_user_task_d 上按 dt 差分 is_claimed，粒度一样；本列是为 30 天以外保留这个能力","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"claim_node_mask","ordinal":18,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"积分节点领奖位图，取自 cycle 层 claim_mask 原值。第 N 位为1表示 node_id=N 已领奖。同上，当日新领节点 = 今日值 & ~昨日值。⚠️读取必须用位运算，不可用 BIN+SUBSTR（位序会颠倒）","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"first_done_time","ordinal":19,"type":"datetime","nullable":true,"comment":"本期首次完成任务的时刻，秒级。统计方式：MIN(done_time)。done_time 是全链路唯一有真实时间戳的状态","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"last_done_time","ordinal":20,"type":"datetime","nullable":true,"comment":"本期最近一次完成任务的时刻，秒级。统计方式：MAX(done_time)","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"issued_node_cnt","ordinal":21,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日已发放的积分节点个数，单位：个。判据 (claim_mask >> node_id) > 0 即「填到最高已领位」。统计方式：COUNT(DISTINCT node_id)。这是【已发放】口径的基数。⚠️不含 claim_mask=0 的玩家（实测 2,090 人、是真实达成者，刻意放弃，见 04 文件头）","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"claimed_node_cnt","ordinal":22,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日已领取的积分节点个数，单位：个。统计方式：取 cycle 层 BIT_COUNT(claim_mask)。恒 <= issued_node_cnt。填位法下两者只差跳号领取带出的 80 个节点","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"award_coin_amt","ordinal":23,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"【已发放】截至快照日积分节点奖励折合金币总额，单位：金币。统计方式：SUM。⚠️2026-10-16 业务口径：已发放 = 位图填到最高已领位，不看该节点是否真领。= item_cnt × item_unit_value（同日另取消 0.9 折扣系数）。价值未知的道具不计入","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"award_coin_amt_claimed","ordinal":24,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"【已领取】其中实际被领取的部分，单位：金币。统计方式：SUM(is_claimed=1)。仅供与旧口径对数，业务取数请用 award_coin_amt。实测未领占已发放节点数的 0.04%（80/180,239）","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"award_coin_amt_expired","ordinal":25,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"其中「周期已过期且未领」的部分，单位：金币。expire_award=0 过期不补发，所以这部分玩家实际永远拿不到，但按业务口径仍计入 award_coin_amt。需要保守估算发放时减掉它","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"award_item_value_unknown_cnt","ordinal":26,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日折币价值未知的奖励道具条数，单位：条。>0 说明 award_coin_amt 偏低，需补道具配置，不可当0处理","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"tour_entry_consume_amt","ordinal":27,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"截至快照日赛事报名费净消耗，单位：金币。口径：change_type=1消耗 减 change_type in (4退赛,5邮件退费)，均为金币(change_propid=1)；窗口下界固定为活动开启日 2026-09-24","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"user_rtp","ordinal":28,"type":"double","nullable":true,"comment":"用户级RTP，无单位。= award_coin_amt / tour_entry_consume_amt（分母已扣退赛4与邮件退费5）。分母为0时为 NULL。⚠️分子是运营域任务奖励、分母是游戏域赛事消耗，跨域口径；任务送的门票确实流向赛事报名（实测 product_id=32 有用 4000016 门票报名的记录）","is_key":false,"is_partition":false,"dropped":false,"collected_at":"2026-11-05 01:15:26","proposal":"","governance":""},{"name":"is_cycle_orphan","ordinal":29,"type":"bigint","nullable":true,"comment":"该玩家在 tms_task_user_cycle 中是否查无此人：1是 0否。实测1085行占0.002%","